"avidyā-yātanā    āra nāhi sahe","    janama-maraṇa-mālā"],"translation":["O Gopīnāth, remove the suffering of saṁsāra. I can no longer tolerate the pain of ignorance or the cycle of birth and death."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["    gopīnāth, āmi ta’ kāmera dāsa","viṣaya-vāsanā    jāgichhe hṛdaye","    phā̐dichhe karama phā̐sa"],"translation":["O Gopīnāth, I am a servant of lust. Worldly desires have awakened in my heart, and the noose of karma has tightened around my neck."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["    gopīnāth, kabe vā jāgiba āmi","kāma-rūpa ari    dūre teyāgiba","    hṛdaye sphuribe tumi"],"translation":["O Gopīnāth, when will I wake up? When will I abandon my enemy—lust? When will You appear in my heart?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["    gopīnāth, āmi ta’ tomāra jana","tomāre chhāḍiyā    saṁsāra bhajinu","    bhuliyā āpana-dhana"],"translation":["O Gopīnāth, I am Yours, but I have abandoned You and engaged in worldly life, forgetting my actual wealth."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["    gopīnāth, tumi ta’ sakali jāna","āpanāra jane    daṇḍiyā ekhana","    śrī-charaṇe deha sthāna"],"translation":["O Gopīnāth, You know everything. Having now punished Your servant, give him a place at Your holy feet."],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["    gopīnāth, ei ki vichāra tava","vimukha dekhiyā    chhāḍa nija-jane","    nā kara karuṇā-lava"],"translation":["O Gopīnāth, is this Your judgement? Seeing me averse to You, You abandon Your servant and do not grant him even a trace of mercy?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"7","text":["    gopīnāth, āmi ta’ mūrakha ati","kise bhāla haya    kabhu nā bujhinu","    tāi hena mama gati"],"translation":["O Gopīnāth, I am very foolish. I have never understood what is good for me. Therefore my condition is such."],"isLong":false},{"number":"8","text":["    gopīnāth, tumi ta’ paṇḍita-vara","mūḍhera maṅgala    sadā anveṣibe","    e dāse nā bhāva para"],"translation":["O Gopīnāth, You are the wisest person. Always try to uplift this fool and do not consider this servant an outsider."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/gopinath-ghuchao-samsara-jvala","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Nivedana-02-22-2"},"head":{"canonical":"/en-pe/gopinath-ghuchao-samsara-jvala/","description":"Nivedana — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Pocket Kirtan Guide.","title":"Nivedana. by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur. Part 2 | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-pe","slug":"gopinath-ghuchao-samsara-jvala"}}